[en]
[1.0.0]
# Version 1.0.0
- Initial release of KF2MOD-EU Monitor.
- Real-time server status monitoring (players, waves, maps).
- Highly customizable home screen widget (theme, background image, layout).
- Notifications for tracked players and server population threshold.
- Built-in app updater and cloud server synchronization.

